{"id": 67, "name": "Leomord", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/d/de/Hero671-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142250", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Burst"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["70", "50", "30", "60"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "A sworn knight who vowed to guard Necrokeep until his last breath.", "skills": [{"name": "The Oath Keeper", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_04b94a8560d7cba08238b017a929611e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Leomord's Basic Attacks and skills grant him 25 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Oath Keeper</span> energy each time they deal damage to targets. When the energy reaches 100, his next Basic Attack deals 200% Crit Damage and restores 100 <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+10*Hero Level)</span><span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+15% Extra Max HP)</span> HP.\nLeomord's Basic Attacks cannot normally Crit, and every 1% Crit Chance is converted into 1% Crit Damage.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mounted State</span>: Each <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Oath Keeper</span> energy gain is increased by 200%."}, {"name": "Momentum", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f95e7440099a5481f3082f48ca6b499d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6", "desc": "Leomord begins channeling, slowing enemies in the target direction by 25%. When the channeling is complete or interrupted, he thrusts his sword in the same direction, dealing up to 500<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+180% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit (scales with channeling time; increased to 160% against creeps except the Turtle and Lord) and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Cast the skill again to cancel the channeling and immediately perform the thrust."}, {"name": "Decimation Assault", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_658b998993378d3089b609649ae93270.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Leomord charges in a designated direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies along the way and slowing them by 30% for 1s."}, {"name": "Phantom Steed", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d1f7fce40b8a283934077f2481b6d402.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 30", "desc": "Leomord summons <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Barbiel</span> to rush to him, knocking back and dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to all enemies in its path.\nIf <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Barbiel</span> comes in contact with Leomord, they will enter the Mounted State, gaining 50% Movement Speed that decays over 2s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mounted State</span>: Leomord gains a brand-new set of skills, and his Basic Attack can be used while moving and hits a circular area to deal AOE damage. Leomord also gains 70 Movement Speed and 30 Physical & Magic Defense. This lasts 10s."}, {"name": "The Oath Keeper", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_04b94a8560d7cba08238b017a929611e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Leomord's Basic Attacks and skills grant him 25 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Oath Keeper</span> energy each time they deal damage to targets. When the energy reaches 100, his next Basic Attack deals 200% Crit Damage and restores 100 <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+10*Hero Level)</span><span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+15% Extra Max HP)</span> HP.\nLeomord's Basic Attacks cannot normally Crit, and every 1% Crit Chance is converted into 1% Crit Damage.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mounted State</span>: Each <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Oath Keeper</span> energy gain is increased by 200%."}, {"name": "Phantom Stomp", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c8aff6534951b28bb0f4dd032892085a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5", "desc": "Barbiel leaps forward, dealing 325<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the landing area and in front of him, while slowing them by 40% for 1s."}, {"name": "Phantom Charge", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_7e557b2c3334edde0a1029ac434ff3cc.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7", "desc": "Barbiel charges forward in a designated direction, and knocks back all enemies on the path, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Phantom Steed", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d1f7fce40b8a283934077f2481b6d402.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 30", "desc": "Leomord summons <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Barbiel</span> to rush to him, knocking back and dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to all enemies in its path.\nIf <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Barbiel</span> comes in contact with Leomord, they will enter the Mounted State, gaining 50% Movement Speed that decays over 2s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mounted State</span>: Leomord gains a brand-new set of skills, and his Basic Attack can be used while moving and hits a circular area to deal AOE damage. Leomord also gains 70 Movement Speed and 30 Physical & Magic Defense. This lasts 10s."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Encourage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_570fc1bf3d3e97c6ecc0e65859cfe715.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Brute Force Breastplate", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b830fbf0e825c3c46010bf5fbf814767.png"}, {"name": "Queen's Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6bab0819a3203e65eb28da7ef1c4478.png"}, {"name": "Rose Gold Meteor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da94005b9d67024c8f189889ba6368cb.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_282edd3dffb41e1b95b08592707ba88f.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Rupture", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8e7a237c8961044ad43af1a79d5b3756.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Seasoned Hunter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fe6ad272b01110393d55b4326164a3fa.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Killing Spree", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_264b83700e778b3eaa4a62d8e7a22a6c.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Re